      "notes": [
        {
          "no": 0,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Customer wanted prices for 2027, advanced registered everything, customer aware of the pricing and how it works.",
          "displayName": "Jacqueline McDonald",
          "dateModified": "2025-01-22T11:02:35",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~0",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 1,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Hello Oscar,\n\nIt\u0027s not jumped up that much, it may even come down when its properly confirmed. This is based on the Holiday Inn Lake Buena Vista where you stayed previously. Then the two nights at Loews Royal Pacific. \n\nAll adults on the tickets, to be honest with you there\u0027s not much of a difference between an adult and child price now.\n\nThe NHS discount wont be applied until its all out to properly confirm as at this stage its an advanced registration.\n\nYour deposit payment will secure a provisional booking only. Your booking, including full details and the cost of your package holiday, will not be confirmed until it becomes available. This is usually 10 months before your planned departure date. We will contact you to advise you of the changes to your holiday before confirming the details of your booking. You will have 7 days to decide whether or not to accept the changes. Please ensure that you read our booking terms and conditions.\n\nI hope this helps.\n\nKindest Regards\nJacqueline",
          "displayName": "Jacqueline McDonald",
          "dateModified": "2025-01-22T12:22:00",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~1",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 22,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "From:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Friday, December 5, 2025 10:12 AM\nTo:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHi Ray\n\nYour new total holiday cost ( without\u00A0 Portofino) is \u00A310,459.11 (\u00A3971.48 less). Leaving you a balance of \u00A39709.11 due by 14th\u00A0July 2026.\n\nI have sent you an updated correct booking invoice.\n\nKind regards\nAndrew\n\n\nAndrew Cawley\nSupervisor Braehead Glasgow\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 571 9688\n\nLet us know what we did well, or how we can improve: Share your experience on Trustpilot by clicking here.\nHow did you rate the service you received today? You can let us know by filling out our short survey, this will be sent to your email very soon.\n \n\u00A0\nProudly partners with\n \n\n\n\n________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Thursday, December 4, 2025 9:58 PM\nTo:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHey,\n\nI got a notification to say the hotel had been removed but can you confirm the total balance outstanding please?\n\nCheers,\n\nRay",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-12-05T10:16:31",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~22",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "** Flights booked OODR \u00A3229.65 total more, will keep an eye on accommodation and rest of ADV REG components **",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-07-03T18:55:11",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~2",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "** Price back to adv reg price as rebooked flights \u00A312,568.76 **",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-07-14T15:11:49",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~3",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "From:\u00A0Braehead Next \u003Csanitized\u002Bd61844ee@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Wednesday, July 23, 2025 9:40 AM\nTo:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Florida 2027\n\u00A0\nHi Ray\u00A0\n\nThanks for getting in touch.\n\nJacqueline has left the company now, we are still waiting on some of your 2027 holiday details being released. This is constantly checked and hotels and Park Passes are booked as they become available.\n\nWe don\u0027t offer the Drury Plaza I\u0027m afraid, but we do offer Renaissance Orlando, Wyndham Disney Springs and Hilton Buena Vista Palace that are all at Disney Springs but none of these options have been released for October 2027 as yet.\n\nLet us know if you have any questions at all.\n\nKind regards\nAndrew\n\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\nNext Home Store\nUnit A Braehead Retail Park\nGlasgow\n0344 571 9688\n \n\u00A0\nProudly partners with\n \n\n\n________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Tuesday, July 22, 2025 3:34 PM\nTo:\u00A0Braehead Next \u003Csanitized\u002Bd61844ee@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Florida 2027\n\u00A0\nHi,\n\nI sent the email below to Jacqueline who I was previously speaking to about a holiday we have pre-booked for October 2027 but I got a bounce back email. Is Jacqueline still available or do I now have the wrong email address?\n\nCheers,\n\nRay\n\n________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A022 July 2025 14:30\nTo:\u00A0Jacqueline McDonald \u003Csanitized\u002B48c77021@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Florida 2027\n\u00A0\nHi there,\n\nI hope you are doing well. I have a feeling its still a little early but I wondered when we would be able to firm up on the holiday for October 2027.\n\nAlso just to say I\u0027ve been looking into it and Drury Plaza Hotel Orlando - Disney Springs Area is my preferred hotel. It looks to be eligible for Early Theme Park Entry\u00A0for Disney Resort Hotel Guests and this would be really useful. I couldn\u0027t see Drury on the Virgin Holidays website is this something you can do?\n\nCheers,\n\nRay",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-07-23T09:40:43",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~4",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Braehead Next \u003Csanitized\u002Bd61844ee@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Thursday, July 24, 2025 6:20 PM\nTo:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Florida 2027\n\u00A0\nHi Ray\n\u00A0\nNo trouble at all,\n\nAny of us can help with your booking, this email address is for the store and any emails would be picked up by whoever is in the store on any given day. You can email me directly on sanitized\u002B912fac16@example.com though if you like.\n\nThe Advance Registration booking process is exactly as Jacqueline explained to you so that\u0027s correct, we normally have all the details released and a confirmed price by 11 months in advance of your holiday departure date, although sometimes this can take up to 10 months in advance for some accommodation to be released.\n\nThere aren\u0027t any plans as far as I\u0027m aware for us to offer Drury Plaza but this could potentially change when all of the 2027 accommodation has been released, if you did want to leave a gap in the itinerary and arrange the Drury Plaza stay yourself then that is an option yes.\n\nOnce we are able to give you a confirmed price for the park passes you will have the option to confirm them or remove them from your booking.\n\nI hope this is helpful.\n\nKind regards\nAndrew\n\n\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\nNext Home Store\nUnit A Braehead Retail Park\nGlasgow\n0344 571 9688\n \n\u00A0\nProudly partners with\n \n\n________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Thursday, July 24, 2025 6:07 PM\nTo:\u00A0Braehead Next \u003Csanitized\u002Bd61844ee@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Florida 2027\n\u00A0\nHi Andrew,\n\nThanks for getting back to me and letting me know about Jacqueline .\n\nCan you confirm who will be my point of contact going forward on this? When speaking to Jacqueline she explained this is a pre-registration and when the details are confirmed and we had a final price we would sign off if we wanted to go ahead. If the prices weren\u0027t working out my deposit would be returned.\n\nIs there any option around the Drury Plaza as that will be my preferred location? Looking at the options you provided while these offering early entry none of the room situations are an option for us. At the time of going our kids will be 12 and 14 so two double beds isn\u0027t an option and only the Hilton seems to offer two double beds and a sofa bed but the sofa bed looks rubbish. I understand this is a package so could we book the flights and universal hotel through you and source the Drury ourself?\u00A0\n\nI appreciate its still very early for the 2027 prices but do you know when this could be confirmed with actual prices? Also just in case this impacts the availability I\u0027m not 100% on where we will get our park tickets its really depends on the price as I may get them elsewhere.\u00A0\n\nCheers,\n\nRay",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-07-24T18:21:26",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~5",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 6,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "From:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Monday, October 20, 2025 11:35 AM\nTo:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nMorning Ray\n\nJust to let you now that Sonesta ES Suites Lake Buena Vista is now released for your dates in 2027.\n\nI wanted just to check with you if you wanted us to remove the advance registration for the park passes that you currently have included, I know you had mentioned this before.\n\nUniversal Royal Pacific is still not out yet for the 12th\u00A0October 2027, Hard Rock and Portofino Bay are though if you would like to include one of those instead. ( they still include Universal Express Pass)\n\nLet me know and I\u0027ll get your booking changed and the total cost updated.\n\nKind regards\nAndrew",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-10-20T11:50:21",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~6",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 7,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Monday, October 20, 2025 1:25 PM\nTo:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHi Ray\n\nNo trouble, I\u0027ll send you out an updated booking invoice with the confirmed details on there, the total cost is \u00A36184 leaving you a balance of \u00A35434.\n\nYou\u0027ll have 7 days from today to decide if you would like to keep the booking or cancel it, after the 7 days your booking will be considered confirmed and normal booking terms \u0026 conditions will apply.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions.\n\nKind regards\nAndrew\n\nAndrew Cawley\nSupervisor Braehead Glasgow\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 571 9688\n\nLet us know what we did well, or how we can improve: Share your experience on Trustpilot by clicking here.\nHow did you rate the service you received today? You can let us know by filling out our short survey, this will be sent to your email very soon.\n \n\u00A0\nProudly partners with\n \n\n\n\n________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Monday, October 20, 2025 1:18 PM\nTo:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHey,\n\nThanks for getting in contact. I\u0027ll go with the base package for now once you confirm costs and may add on the Universal and park tickets later like we did last time.\n\nI\u0027ll wait to hear the quote price.\u00A0\n\nCheers,\n\nRay",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-10-20T13:26:15",
