        {
          "no": 8,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "** Cancelled off adv reg passes and royal pacific as per request from customer. have adv 7 days from today to decide of proceeding with the booking at ttal cost \u00A36184.07 and then booking will be confirmed and normal t\u0027s \u0026c\u0027s apply **\n\nFrom:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Monday, October 20, 2025 1:25 PM\nTo:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHi Ray\n\nNo trouble, I\u0027ll send you out an updated booking invoice with the confirmed details on there, the total cost is \u00A36184 leaving you a balance of \u00A35434.\n\nYou\u0027ll have 7 days from today to decide if you would like to keep the booking or cancel it, after the 7 days your booking will be considered confirmed and normal booking terms \u0026 conditions will apply.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions.\n\nKind regards\nAndrew\n\nAndrew Cawley\nSupervisor Braehead Glasgow\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 571 9688\n\nLet us know what we did well, or how we can improve: Share your experience on Trustpilot by clicking here.\nHow did you rate the service you received today? You can let us know by filling out our short survey, this will be sent to your email very soon.\n \n\u00A0\nProudly partners with\n \n\n\n\n________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Monday, October 20, 2025 1:18 PM\nTo:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHey,\n\nThanks for getting in contact. I\u0027ll go with the base package for now once you confirm costs and may add on the Universal and park tickets later like we did last time.\n\nI\u0027ll wait to hear the quote price.\u00A0\n\nCheers,\n\nRay",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-10-20T13:26:59",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~8",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 9,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Monday, October 20, 2025 1:41 PM\nTo:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHi Oscar\n\nWe can check indirect flights when they come out but that wont be until the end of November 2026 ( 11 months in advance of your return flight).\n\nAndrew\n\n\nAndrew Cawley\nSupervisor Braehead Glasgow\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 571 9688\n\nLet us know what we did well, or how we can improve: Share your experience on Trustpilot by clicking here.\nHow did you rate the service you received today? You can let us know by filling out our short survey, this will be sent to your email very soon.\n \n\u00A0\nProudly partners with\n \n\n\n\n________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Monday, October 20, 2025 1:38 PM\nTo:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nJust a quick query. If we were to look at indirect flights what would be the price difference?\n\nLast time we were booked direct but due to a hurricane were delayed a few days and got a flight via Amsterdam and it was cheaper.\u00A0",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-10-20T13:47:12",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~9",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 10,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "** BOOKING NOW CONFIRMED NO LONGER AN ADV REG NORMAL T\u0027S AND C\u0027S APPLY **\n\n\n________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Tuesday, October 21, 2025 4:21 PM\nTo:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHey,\n\nHappy to proceed with the quote. Just for reference if we did add the two nights at Hard Rock on 12th/13th of October 2027 what would be the cost?\n\nCheers,\n\nRay",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
          "dateModified": "2025-10-21T16:45:16",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~10",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 11,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "________________________________________\nFrom:\u00A0Andrew Cawley \u003Csanitized\u002B88055ca3@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Tuesday, October 21, 2025 4:39 PM\nTo:\u00A0Oscar Lewis \u003Csanitized\u002Bd4ead516@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Re: Virgin Atlantic Holidays 6822307\n\u00A0\nHi Ray\u00A0\n\nNo trouble at all.\n\nHard Rock is \u00A31119 for the 2 nights 12th\u00A0\u0026 13th\u00A0October and Portofino Bay is \u00A3972 also.\n\nKind regards\n\nAndrew",
          "displayName": "Andrew Cawley",
