          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~13",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 14,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Hi,\n\nThanks for getting back to me. So just to confirm its 4,272 for 2 weeks at both disney and universal. Also its not restricted to a single day at epic universe.\n\nAlso there is no upfront payment and should we have to cancel for any reason we would only lose our deposit and not owe any balance for these?\n\nCheers,\n\nRay",
          "displayName": "Jacqueline Gough",
          "dateModified": "2025-11-16T14:12:30",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~14",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 15,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Hi Oscar\n\nThat\u0027s correct 14 day park hopper \u0026 its unlimited access to epic universe.\n\nNo upfront payment they just get paid with your balance due date of the holiday.\n\nYes if you were to cancel right up until your balance due date it would just be deposit you would loose.\n\nKind regards",
          "displayName": "Jacqueline Gough",
          "dateModified": "2025-11-16T14:12:43",
