        {
          "no": 16,
          "code": "Sonesta ES Suites Lake Buena Vista - Renovation project",
          "description": "Sonesta ES Suites Lake Buena Vista - Renovation project",
          "note": "The Sonesta ES Suites Orlando - Lake Buena Vista have advised us that \ncommencing the 1st November 2024, \nSome construction and renovation works will be taking place around the property.\nThe main works involve building repairs to each of the six buildings, as well as the\nrepainting of the buildings. As work takes place to each building one at a time, \nit will be closed, and guests will be allocated rooms in another building.\nWorks will not be based on the interior of the buildings and will take place 7 days \nper week between the hours of 8am \u2013 6pm.\nAt different times during the work, some outside recreational offerings may be\naffected, but this will not be for the entire duration of the works. \nYou can receive further information on impacted facilities at the time of check in \nwith the hotel. While noise disruption can be anticipated, the hotel has carefully \nplanned works around maintaining guest enjoyment",
          "dateModified": "2025-02-24T16:38:46",
